From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shell: Form dialogs as pages of the navigation

Plinius: cc-plinius-dialog-pages.c (a file of its own) defines
adw_dialog_present(), adw_dialog_close() and adw_dialog_force_close() in
the executable, so the form dialogs of all panels open as pages of the
window's navigation instead of sheets over the window. Alerts and
libadwaita's own dialogs stay dialogs.
---
--- a/shell/meson.build
+++ b/shell/meson.build
@@ -111,7 +111,8 @@ libshell_dep = declare_dependency(
 # gnome-control-center #
 ########################
 
-shell_sources = common_sources + files('main.c')
+# Plinius: form dialogs as pages of the navigation (the executable overrides adw_dialog_present)
+shell_sources = common_sources + files('main.c', 'cc-plinius-dialog-pages.c')
 
 shell_deps = common_deps + [
   libdevice_dep,
